~ tongue: bare
~ whisper and listen: a port is a latch that remembers the last write
rite
  whisper p8 0x2A to port 0xE9
  speak listen port 0xE9
  speak listen port 0x60
  whisper p16 0x1FF to port 0x70
  speak listen p16 port 0x70
  speak listen port 0x70
  whisper p32 0x12345678 to port 0x80
  speak listen p32 port 0x80
  speak listen p16 port 0x80
  whisper p8 300 to port 0x90
  speak listen port 0x90
end
